            "To investigate the impact of supervision on \\bertem{} and \\mtbmodel{}, we introduce increasing amounts of FewRel's training data. Figure~\\ref{fig:fewrel-limit-examples} shows the increase in performance as we either increase the number of training examples for each relation type, or we increase the number of relation types in the training data.\n",
